{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1366330-oracle-heroes","id":1366330,"title":"Oracle Heroes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-02-08T08:29:02-08:00","id":1366330,"title":"Oracle Heroes","content":"Alright, so I didn't participate in the 2nd Dark Eras Kickstarter, but I've been catching some mention around here of there being new Hero stuff being introduced in one of the settings, about them being Oracles.<br /> <br /> So, what is this about?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/851-paradim","name":"Paradim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar851_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-02-08T09:12:01-08:00","id":1366336,"title":"","content":"They're a type of cat.<br /> <br /> So Hunger in the Black Lands posits a proto-Hero called Oracles who aren't one man armies ramboing against Beasts, but are instead diviners who can more easily locate Beasts through an improved Heroic Stalking and Omen Sensitvity, and primarily apply Anathema through research and storytelling to other people (though the old ways remain open). They fade away once the Heroic Narrative properly settles into the Bright Dream.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanea